## 5. API 調用規範 (API Call Rules)

### 5.1 API 服務封裝

**所有 API 調用必須通過 `services/api/` 目錄下的服務封裝：**

```typescript
// src/services/api/llm.ts
import axios from 'axios';
import { API_BASE_URL } from '@/config/api';
import type { LLMProvider, LLMProviderList } from '@/types/api';

const apiClient = axios.create({
  baseURL: `${API_BASE_URL}/api/v1`,
  headers: {
    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
  },
});

// 請求攔截器（添加認證 token）
apiClient.interceptors.request.use((config) => {
  const token = localStorage.getItem('auth_token');
  if (token) {
    config.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${token}`;
  }
  return config;
});

// 響應攔截器（錯誤處理）
apiClient.interceptors.response.use(
  (response) => response,
  (error) => {
    if (error.response?.status === 401) {
      // 處理未授權錯誤
      window.location.href = '/login';
    }
    return Promise.reject(error);
  }
);

export const llmApi = {
  // 獲取 LLM Provider 列表
  getProviders: async (): Promise<LLMProviderList> => {
    const response = await apiClient.get<LLMProviderList>('/llm/providers');
    return response.data;
  },

  // 創建 LLM Provider
  createProvider: async (provider: Partial<LLMProvider>): Promise<LLMProvider> => {
    const response = await apiClient.post<LLMProvider>('/llm/providers', provider);
    return response.data;
  },

  // 更新 LLM Provider
  updateProvider: async (id: string, provider: Partial<LLMProvider>): Promise<LLMProvider> => {
    const response = await apiClient.patch<LLMProvider>(`/llm/providers/${id}`, provider);
    return response.data;
  },

  // 刪除 LLM Provider
  deleteProvider: async (id: string): Promise<void> => {
    await apiClient.delete(`/llm/providers/${id}`);
  },
};
```

### 5.2 自定義 Hook 封裝

**使用自定義 Hook 封裝 API 調用邏輯：**

```typescript
// src/hooks/useLLMProviders.ts
import { useState, useEffect } from 'react';
import { llmApi } from '@/services/api/llm';
import type { LLMProvider } from '@/types/api';

export const useLLMProviders = () => {
  const [providers, setProviders] = useState<LLMProvider[]>([]);
  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(true);
  const [error, setError] = useState<Error | null>(null);

  useEffect(() => {
    const fetchProviders = async () => {
      try {
        setLoading(true);
        const data = await llmApi.getProviders();
        setProviders(data.items);
      } catch (err) {
        setError(err as Error);
      } finally {
        setLoading(false);
      }
    };

    fetchProviders();
  }, []);

  const createProvider = async (provider: Partial<LLMProvider>) => {
    try {
      const newProvider = await llmApi.createProvider(provider);
      setProviders((prev) => [...prev, newProvider]);
      return newProvider;
    } catch (err) {
      setError(err as Error);
      throw err;
    }
  };

  return {
    providers,
    loading,
    error,
    createProvider,
  };
};
```

### 5.3 錯誤處理規範

1. **必須處理所有 API 錯誤**
2. **使用統一的錯誤提示組件**
3. **記錄錯誤到日誌系統（可選）**

