## 11. 性能優化規範 (Performance Rules)

### 11.1 組件優化

1. **使用 `React.memo` 優化組件渲染**
2. **使用 `useMemo` 和 `useCallback` 優化計算和函數**
3. **避免不必要的重新渲染**

```typescript
// ✅ 正確
const MemoizedComponent = React.memo(({ data }: Props) => {
  const processedData = useMemo(() => processData(data), [data]);
  const handleClick = useCallback(() => {
    // 處理邏輯
  }, []);
  
  return <div>{processedData}</div>;
});
```

### 11.2 代碼分割

**使用 React.lazy 進行路由級代碼分割：**

```typescript
const Dashboard = React.lazy(() => import('@/pages/Dashboard'));
const LLMProvider = React.lazy(() => import('@/pages/LLMProvider'));

<Suspense fallback={<Loading />}>
  <Routes>
    <Route path="dashboard" element={<Dashboard />} />
    <Route path="llm-provider" element={<LLMProvider />} />
  </Routes>
</Suspense>
```

